  "reply_raw": "<think>**Considering account conditions**\n\nI’m thinking about the account types for a certain resource. The idea of removing the account_type condition and just using amounts less than or equal to $100,000 seems broad. However, it might be better to keep it open. The recurring tasks have dual signatures and specific urgency with account-vendor details. I guess we can establish the conditions that fit these tasks effectively. It's all about finding the right balance!</think>\n\n{\"mode\":\"precedent\",\"rule\":{\"action\":\"wire_transfer\",\"resource\":\"acct-vendor\",\"conditions\":{\"urgency\":[\"eq\",\"1\"],\"amount_usd\":[\"le\",\"100000\"],\"account_type\":[\"any\",\"*\"],\"dual_sign\":[\"eq\",\"1\"]}}}",
